OL,3,GNEWSAWoman arrested in murder probe as
OL,4,Aman found dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof murder after a man was found dead in
OL,8,Fa property in Margate.
OL,10,FPolice were called to Millmead Road on
OL,11,FThursday at about 15:00 GMT, following
OL,12,Fconcern for someone in the property,
OL,13,Fand found the body of a man in his 50s.
OL,15,FA 40-year-old woman has been arrested
OL,16,Fand remains in custody, a Kent Police
OL,17,Fspokesperson said. The man who died has
OL,18,Fnot yet been named.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
